stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NoCurrent
    state "No current evidence. Research needed." as NoCurrent
    state "Current sourced verification. Verified." as Verified
    state "Current conflict. Review needed." as Conflict
    state "Future evidence only. Research needed." as Future
    state "Expired evidence only. Research needed." as Expired
    NoCurrent --> Future: A finding has a future observation
    Future --> Verified: The clock reaches a sourced verification
    Future --> Conflict: The clock reaches a discrepancy
    NoCurrent --> Verified: A sourced verification is observed at or before the clock
    Verified --> Conflict: A current discrepancy is recorded
    Conflict --> Verified: The discrepancy expires and verification remains current
    Verified --> Expired: All current findings expire
    Expired --> Verified: A current sourced verification is recorded
    NoCurrent --> NoCurrent: Invalid observation, nothing found, or no source
    note right of Future
      Every finding stays visible in evidence.
      One observed clock governs each evaluation.
      Expiry follows the existing database policy.
    end note
    %% never A future or invalid observation establishes verification or an active discrepancy.
